WEBVTT

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:02.216
Walk right now in the direction
of your healthiest, most fulfilled life,

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.976
because self-care is a revolutionary act.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.336
Number two:

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:09.576
when you learn the way forward,
come back and get a sister.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.936
So in our case,
start a team with your friends --

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.856
your friends, your family, your church.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.496
Number three:

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.960
rally your allies.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.856
Every single person in this room

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.976
is complicit in
a Tubman-inspired takeover.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.856
And number four:

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:28.160
find joy.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:31.176
The most underreported
fact of Harriet Tubman